AGS was 4.1 (range: 2–5). Nine (26%) patients prematurely concluded the trial. At the end of phase 1, a greater hair    
regrowth was observed in 89% of the head sites treated with CF vs. 11% in the sites treated with PF. The RGS was 1.2 ±  
